  if (life) life.html = "<p>Networked offices, personal computers, electronic records, home video, nuclear grids, jet travel, container ports, and satellite services are ordinary but unequally distributed. Paper files, cash, CRT displays, repair shops, older housing, and labor-intensive services remain equally normal.</p><p><a href='everyday-life-in-2000.html'>Everyday life at the millennium</a> follows five metropolitan routes—German certified order, Japanese production networks, Commonwealth public and commercial institutions, American platform markets, and Latin technical confederation—beside sharply unequal imperial peripheries.</p>";
